{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-trip-lithuania-from-vilnius-airport/audio/main-929c0a2cb184.mp3","durationSec":246.432,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.34,"text":"You land at Vilnius International Airport."},{"start":3.1,"end":5.4,"text":"This airport is the main airport for Vilnius."},{"start":6.12,"end":7.58,"text":"Many airlines fly here."},{"start":8.34,"end":10.7,"text":"You walk with the other people to passport control."},{"start":11.32,"end":12.22,"text":"You wait in a line."},{"start":12.74,"end":14.18,"text":"An officer looks at your passport."},{"start":14.72,"end":15.66,"text":"Then you take your bag."},{"start":16.78,"end":18.18,"text":"Next, you think about money."},{"start":18.18,"end":20.66,"text":"Prices in Vilnius are in euros (€)."},{"start":21.44,"end":26.62,"text":"For example, a bus ticket from the airport to the city centre costs €1."},{"start":26.62,"end":28.48,"text":"You buy this bus ticket from the driver."},{"start":29,"end":32.04,"text":"So it is good to have your payment ready before you get on the bus."},{"start":32.78,"end":34.08,"text":"Your phone is important too."},{"start":34.52,"end":36.08,"text":"You need maps and the Bolt app."},{"start":39.94,"end":41.24,"text":"So you look for a SIM card."},{"start":41.98,"end":43.48,"text":"You do not know the price yet."},{"start":43.98,"end":45.34,"text":"Ask at the shop before you buy."},{"start":46.36,"end":48.34,"text":"You have three good ways to get to the city."},{"start":48.96,"end":51.08,"text":"Each way has a different time and price."},{"start":51.96,"end":53.26,"text":"The first way is the train."},{"start":53.8,"end":56.94,"text":"The train goes from the airport to the central railway station."},{"start":57.48,"end":59.62,"text":"The trip is 4.3 km long."},{"start":59.62,"end":61.74,"text":"It takes about 7 or 8 minutes."},{"start":62.52,"end":65.46,"text":"A ticket costs €0.45, and you can buy it online."},{"start":66.38,"end":68.18,"text":"This train is fast and cheap."},{"start":68.76,"end":70.82,"text":"But it runs only 16 times a day."},{"start":71.12,"end":72.82,"text":"So check the next train time first."},{"start":74.18,"end":75.92,"text":"The second way is the bus."},{"start":76.7,"end":80.02,"text":"The bus takes about 15 minutes to the city centre."},{"start":80.02,"end":82.34,"text":"Several buses go to the city centre and the Old Town."},{"start":83.12,"end":85.38,"text":"You can buy a €1 ticket from the driver."},{"start":86.12,"end":91.82,"text":"City tickets cost €1 for 30 minutes or €1.25 for 60 minutes."},{"start":92.8,"end":95.44,"text":"The third way is a taxi or a ride app."},{"start":95.44,"end":100.8,"text":"A taxi from the airport to Cathedral Square in the Old Town costs about €10."},{"start":101.88,"end":103.26,"text":"It takes about 15 minutes."},{"start":103.8,"end":105.8,"text":"You find taxis at the arrivals area."},{"start":105.8,"end":108.78,"text":"Bolt is a big ride company in Vilnius."},{"start":109.48,"end":112.3,"text":"Bolt and Uber work 24 hours a day, every day."},{"start":112.7,"end":115.34,"text":"Open the app and check the price before you say yes."},{"start":116.16,"end":117.22,"text":"You arrive in the city."},{"start":117.63,"end":119.48,"text":"You walk into Vilnius Old Town."},{"start":120.38,"end":122.12,"text":"The Old Town is very old."},{"start":122.58,"end":125.64,"text":"Many of its streets and buildings are hundreds of years old."},{"start":126.26,"end":129.04,"text":"It is one of the largest old towns in Northern Europe."},{"start":129.68,"end":132.98,"text":"So you see many small streets and many old buildings."},{"start":133.5,"end":134.76,"text":"You see two big squares."},{"start":135.32,"end":136.66,"text":"One is Cathedral Square."},{"start":137.14,"end":138.5,"text":"The other is Town Hall Square."},{"start":139.08,"end":141.66,"text":"You also see the buildings of Vilnius University."},{"start":142.16,"end":143.96,"text":"They are a famous part of the Old Town."},{"start":144.72,"end":145.88,"text":"Then you see the Gate of Dawn."},{"start":145.88,"end":148,"text":"This is an important old gate."},{"start":148.5,"end":151.02,"text":"People built it between 1503 and 1514."},{"start":151.8,"end":152.9,"text":"It was part of the city wall."},{"start":152.9,"end":155.64,"text":"Later, people took down most of the city walls."},{"start":156.24,"end":157.3,"text":"But they kept this gate."},{"start":157.66,"end":159.52,"text":"It has a famous picture of the Virgin Mary."},{"start":160.2,"end":161.36,"text":"Many people come here to pray."},{"start":161.86,"end":164.58,"text":"The church services are in Lithuanian and Polish."},{"start":165.12,"end":166.08,"text":"You find your hotel."},{"start":166.5,"end":167.68,"text":"You go to the front desk."},{"start":168,"end":168.76,"text":"You say your name."},{"start":169.22,"end":170.12,"text":"You show your passport."},{"start":170.78,"end":172.46,"text":"The staff member gives you a key card."},{"start":173.1,"end":174.1,"text":"Now you have a room."},{"start":174.64,"end":176.94,"text":"You are new in Vilnius, so ask for help."},{"start":177.56,"end":179.36,"text":"The front desk is a good place for questions."},{"start":179.36,"end":181.16,"text":"Ask for the Wi-Fi password."},{"start":181.6,"end":182.36,"text":"Ask for a map."},{"start":182.92,"end":185.58,"text":"Ask for the way to Cathedral Square or Town Hall Square."},{"start":186.22,"end":190.36,"text":"These are big squares in the Old Town, so they are easy places to meet people or start a walk."},{"start":191.06,"end":192.32,"text":"You can ask about food too."},{"start":192.32,"end":194.48,"text":"Hotel staff know the area."},{"start":195.38,"end":197.4,"text":"You go to a restaurant near your hotel."},{"start":198.04,"end":199.08,"text":"You look at the menu."},{"start":199.7,"end":201.86,"text":"You see two famous Lithuanian dishes."},{"start":202.6,"end":205.28,"text":"The first dish is cepelinai."},{"start":205.28,"end":208.56,"text":"They are big potato dumplings, often with meat inside."},{"start":209.14,"end":210.14,"text":"The cook boils them."},{"start":210.56,"end":214.32,"text":"They come with a sour cream sauce and small bits of bacon or pork rind."},{"start":214.96,"end":216.54,"text":"This is a warm, heavy meal."},{"start":217,"end":218.7,"text":"It is good after a long trip."},{"start":219.34,"end":222.3,"text":"The second dish is šaltibarščiai."},{"start":222.3,"end":224.58,"text":"This is a cold soup, and it is bright pink."},{"start":225.22,"end":230.48,"text":"It has boiled and cooled beetroot, cucumber, green onion, dill and other herbs."},{"start":231.1,"end":234.2,"text":"The beetroot gives it the pink colour."},{"start":234.2,"end":236.28,"text":"People in Vilnius love this soup."},{"start":237.02,"end":241.24,"text":"Since 2023, Vilnius has a festival for this soup every year."},{"start":241.9,"end":243.56,"text":"The menu shows the prices in euros."},{"start":244.28,"end":245.92,"text":"Read the price before you order."}],"words":[{"text":"You","start":0,"end":0.2},{"text":"land","start":0.2,"end":0.48},{"text":"at","start":0.48,"end":0.86},{"text":"Vilnius","start":0.86,"end":1.24},{"text":"International","start":1.24,"end":1.74},{"text":"Airport","start":1.74,"end":2.34},{"text":"This","start":3.1,"end":3.22},{"text":"airport","start":3.22,"end":3.66},{"text":"is","start":3.66,"end":3.9},{"text":"the","start":3.9,"end":4.06},{"text":"main","start":4.06,"end":4.3},{"text":"airport","start":4.3,"end":4.72},{"text":"for","start":4.72,"end":4.94},{"text":"Vilnius","start":4.94,"end":5.4},{"text":"Many","start":6.12,"end":6.42},{"text":"airlines","start":6.42,"end":6.88},{"text":"fly","start":6.88,"end":7.22},{"text":"here","start":7.22,"end":7.58},{"text":"You","start":8.34,"end":8.48},{"text":"walk","start":8.48,"end":8.72},{"text":"with","start":8.72,"end":8.92},{"text":"the","start":8.92,"end":9.04},{"text":"other","start":9.04